<title>FINLAND: FINNISH 2001 BOND YIELDS 5.59 PCT AT AUCTION.</title>
<headline>FINNISH 2001 BOND YIELDS 5.59 PCT AT AUCTION.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of the</p>
<p>S1/94 bond was announced by the State Treasury Office:</p>
<p> ISSUER:				 Republic of Finland</p>
<p> MATURITY:			     15-05-2001</p>
<p> COUPON:				 10.00 PCT</p>
<p> AUCTION YIELD:			5.59 PCT</p>
<p> PRICE:				  118.75</p>
<p> AUCTION AMOUNT			FIM 1,260 MLN</p>
<p> BID AMOUNT:			   FIM 1,890 MLN</p>
<p> PAYMENT FREQUENCY:		  YEARLY</p>
<p>NOTES:</p>
<p>The previous auction of the bond raised 2.83 billion markka at a price of 116.10 and a yield of 6.24 percent. After today's auction, the outstanding amount is 25,433 billion markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0240</p>
